      <para unique="1262019">OR AVX10.1<anchor id="+941613"/></para>
      </td>
     <td><para unique="1262021">Compare low double precision floating-point value in xmm3/m64 and xmm2 using bits 4:0 of imm8 as comparison predicate with writemask k2 and leave the result in mask register k1.</para>
      </td>
